-30B-A3B: How well can it write long-term memory?"}],"products":[{"slug":"deepseek-harness-mobile-remote","name":"黑粉助手 HyphenAssistant","label":"手机接续 AI 会话","badge":"我做的 · 预览版","facts":["本人配对","macOS / Windows / Linux","需电脑在线"],"releaseRepo":"HackerChi-Hub/hyphen-assistant-releases","fallbackDescription":"用手机浏览器接着操作电脑上的 DeepSeek Harness 会话；需原服务、电脑和网络保持在线，模型费用沿用原配置。","action":"查看产品与下载","description":"用手机浏览器接着操作电脑上的 DeepSeek Harness 会话；需原服务、电脑和网络保持在线，模型费用沿用原配置。","updateSummary":"修复“开放端口”和“动态域名＋开放端口”模式中，电脑无法回读自身外网地址时，配对二维码按钮一直不可用的问题。二维码和一次性配对令牌均在本机生成，不依赖在线二维码服务。外网回读失败时可以先生成二维码，再用手机移动网络实际测试；界面明确提示入口尚未验证。临时链接仍须实际连通后才能生成二维码。","updated":"2026-10-24","activityAt":"2026-10-24T14:51:46Z","version":"1.0.1","releaseUrl":"https://github.com/HackerChi-Hub/hyphen-assistant-releases/releases/tag/v1.0.1","source":"release","platforms":[{"platform":"macOS","version":"1.0.1","prerelease":false,"url":"https://github.com/HackerChi-Hub/hyphen-assistant-releases/releases/tag/v1.0.1","assets":[{"name":"HyphenAssistant-1.0.1-macos-arm64.dmg","url":"https://github.com/HackerChi-Hub/hyphen-assistant-releases/releases/download/v1.0.1/HyphenAssistant-1.0.1-macos-arm64.dmg","id":672501195,"size":61748733,"updatedAt":"2026-10-24T14:41:54Z","digest":"sha256:11bfc13915572dc6c8f910c371555c7f0c21959258b5fe0efbf87de66ded967e"}]},{"platform":"Windows","version":"1.0.1","prerelease":false,"url":"https://github.com/HackerChi-Hub/hyphen-assistant-releases/releases/tag/v1.0.1","assets":[{"name":"HyphenAssistant-1.0.1-windows-x64-setup.exe","url":"https://github.com/HackerChi-Hub/hyphen-assistant-releases/releases/download/v1.0.1/HyphenAssistant-1.0.1-windows-x64-setup.exe","id":672448234,"size":257189477,"updatedAt":"2026-10-24T14:19:03Z","digest":"sha256:82920ab22bd0814cb3860d317c170e36af4a76292bc65e5ef2d7ddf1e4cc8ca4"}]},{"platform":"Linux","version":"1.0.1","prerelease":false,"url":"https://github.com/HackerChi-Hub/hyphen-assistant-releases/releases/tag/v1.0.1","assets":[{"name":"HyphenAssistant-1.0.1-l